<BODY LANG="en-US" DIR="LTR">
<div class="wrapper">
  <SCRIPT type="text/javascript" src="includes/header.js"> </SCRIPT>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="maincol" style="float:left; width:47%;">
        <h1>development resources</h1>
        <div id="maintext" style="font-size:14px;">
                <h2>data</h2>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.developmentdata.org/" target="new window"><b>developmentdata.org</b></A>
                <br>Links to various development datasets.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.thearda.com" target="new window"><b>Association of Religion Data Archives</b></A>
                <br>Free access on quality data on religion.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="https://international.ipums.org/international-action/faq" target="new window"><b>IPUMS International</b></A>
                <br>Integrated international microdata based on national censuses.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.rand.org/labor/FLS/IFLS.html" target="new window"><b>Indonesia Family Life Survey</b></A>
                <br>Longitudinal dataset of Indonesian households.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.bps.go.id" target="new window"><b>BPS-Statistics</b></A>
                <br>Indonesia's statistical agency. <a href="http://www.rand.org/labor/bps.html" target="new window">This link</a> details
                datasets available to purchase from the agency.
                </P>
                <h2 style="text-align:right; padding-top:15px;">research portals</h2>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://sticerd.lse.ac.uk/FIELDWORK/" target="new window"><b>Fieldwork in Development Economics</b></A>
                <br>Resources for researchers who want to do fieldwork.
                </P>
        </div>
    </div>
  <div class="maincol" style="float:right; width:47%;">
      <h1>experimental resources</h1>
        <div id="maintext" style="font-size:14px;">
                <h2>laboratories</h2>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://bbrl.uark.edu/" target="new window"><b>Behavioral Business Research Lab</b></A>
                <br>Walton College's experimental lab. Click <a href="http://bbrl.uark.edu/orientation.asp" target="new window">here</a> to be a participant,
                or <a href="http://bbrl.uark.edu/about.asp" target="new window">here</a> to use the lab.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://dornsife.usc.edu/label" target="new window"><b>Los Angeles Behavioral Economics Lab (LABEL)</b></A>
                <br>USC Economics's experimental lab.
                </P>

                <h2 style="text-align:right; padding-top:15px;">softwares</h2>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.iew.uzh.ch/ztree/index.php" target="new window"><b>z-Tree</b></A>
                <br>A relatively simple to implement (and free) software.
                </P>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://multistage.ssel.caltech.edu/" target="new window"><b>Multistage</b></A>
                <br>Java programming skill is necessary, but it has the advantage of being very flexible (and it's free too).
                </P>
                <h2>teaching</h2>
                <P>
                <A HREF="http://www.moblab.com/" target="new window"><b>Moblab</b></A>
                <br>
                </P>
                
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="clear">
    </div>
  </div>
  <SCRIPT type="text/javascript" src="includes/footer.js"> </SCRIPT>
</div>
